"The vault will lock. The current vault is kept in a file next to it, and the "
"restored vault opens with the master password of the copy."
msgstr ""
"Hvelvet låses. Det gjeldende hvelvet lagres i en fil ved siden av, og det "
"gjenopprettede hvelvet åpnes med kopiens hovedpassord."

msgid "The vault will open automatically at login"
msgstr "Hvelvet åpnes automatisk ved pålogging"

#, rust-format
msgid "The {} entry in the trash is deleted for good. This cannot be undone."
msgid_plural ""
"The {} entries in the trash are deleted for good. This cannot be undone."
msgstr[0] "{} element i papirkurven slettes permanent. Dette kan ikke angres."
msgstr[1] ""
"{} elementer i papirkurven slettes permanent. Dette kan ikke angres."

